# Sonic Heroes (5345002B), single route. lane.titleroutes session 46,
# 2026-09-30, from the Thor survey 0-0-s-1790823803-titleroutes-2951964
# (route-frames, booted at 21:07:49 PDT; the runner's heat stop ended it
# at 226 s). DRAFT until a soak replays it.
#
# The survey's START/A cycles (one press every ~5.5 s) reached Seaside Hill
# with Team Sonic: the 10th START (210857) paused a level whose timer read
# 00:03:96, so the 9th cycle's A (210851) started it. Between 210904 and
# 210918 the team picked up 6 rings and 60 points (A = jump). The FPS
# overlay read 59 in every level frame.
#
# So: nine cycles, then run with the left stick and jump with A, no START
# (it pauses).
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
repeat 9 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
axis LY min
wait 3
shot running
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    press A
    wait 1
    axis LX max
    wait 0.5
    axis LX min
    wait 0.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 2
    shot play
}
